plan.html:89:   <p>An agent can GET /api/debug/flights?date=2026-06-07&amp;status=delayed&amp;limit=50 to query flights, GET /api/debug/ui/homepage to get the exact data the homepage renders, GET /api/debug/ui/stats?range=30 for stats dashboard data, and POST /api/debug/sql with {"sql": "SELECT ..."} for ad-hoc queries. All endpoints return JSON with row counts and query timing. All are gated behind Authorization: Bearer &lt;DEBUG_API_TOKEN&gt;. Raw SQL is SELECT-only.</p>
